{"id":"87e145f3544aae62","group":"68","path":"68/68-thm-jump-theorem.md","title":"Jump Theorem","display":"thm-jump-theorem — Jump Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-thm-jump-theorem","aliases":["68-thm-jump-theorem"],"display":"thm-jump-theorem — Jump Theorem","depends_on":["[[68-df-turing-equivalence]]","[[68-df-turing-reducibility]]","[[68-df-turing-jump]]","[[68-df-oracle-recursively-enumerable-set]]","[[68-df-halting-set]]"],"source_edition":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF","source_location":"§15 pp.58-59 / PDF 67-68, via relativization of §§12 and 14","verification_status":"source-adapted-statement","source_proof_status":"argument-reviewed"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-thm-jump-theorem"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-thm-jump-theorem</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-jump-theorem — Jump Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b2e9363a9f103e32\" href=\"?note=b2e9363a9f103e32\" title=\"68-df-turing-equivalence\">68-df-turing-equivalence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7ed23faee951231d\" href=\"?note=7ed23faee951231d\" title=\"68-df-turing-reducibility\">68-df-turing-reducibility</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36459bc8c6a3f6a6\" href=\"?note=36459bc8c6a3f6a6\" title=\"68-df-turing-jump\">68-df-turing-jump</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a48deec92f1ddb01\" href=\"?note=a48deec92f1ddb01\" title=\"68-df-oracle-recursively-enumerable-set\">68-df-oracle-recursively-enumerable-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"eab12566d8ac44ad\" href=\"?note=eab12566d8ac44ad\" title=\"68-df-halting-set\">68-df-halting-set</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§15 pp.58-59 / PDF 67-68, via relativization of §§12 and 14"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-adapted-statement"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"argument-reviewed"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_T,&lt;_T\">\\(\\le_T,&lt;_T\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"7ed23faee951231d\" href=\"?note=7ed23faee951231d\" title=\"68-df-turing-reducibility\">68-df-turing-reducibility</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_T\">\\(\\equiv_T\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b2e9363a9f103e32\" href=\"?note=b2e9363a9f103e32\" title=\"68-df-turing-equivalence\">68-df-turing-equivalence</a>；跳跃见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"36459bc8c6a3f6a6\" href=\"?note=36459bc8c6a3f6a6\" title=\"68-df-turing-jump\">68-df-turing-jump</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RE}^A\">\\(\\mathrm{RE}^A\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"a48deec92f1ddb01\" href=\"?note=a48deec92f1ddb01\" title=\"68-df-oracle-recursively-enumerable-set\">68-df-oracle-recursively-enumerable-set</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"eab12566d8ac44ad\" href=\"?note=eab12566d8ac44ad\" title=\"68-df-halting-set\">68-df-halting-set</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A&lt;_T A&#39;.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A&lt;_T A&#39;.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\le_T B\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ A&#39;\\le_T B&#39;.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\le_T B\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ A&#39;\\le_T B&#39;.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A&#39;\\in\\mathrm{RE}^A\\ \\land\\ \\forall W\\in\\mathrm{RE}^A\\;(W\\le_T A&#39;).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A&#39;\\in\\mathrm{RE}^A\\ \\land\\ \\forall W\\in\\mathrm{RE}^A\\;(W\\le_T A&#39;).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing&#39;\\equiv_T K.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\varnothing&#39;\\equiv_T K.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应原书 p.59 的最大相对 RE 度及相对化。严格性来自相对对角论证；单调性由用 B 模拟 A 查询并把相对停机问题编译成 B′ 查询得到。普通程序可视为 oracle 程序，空 oracle 的读取可有效换成常值 0，因此两种停机问题有效互译，给出 ∅′≡_T K。旧第三式的 ≤₁ 强化没有在本次读取的原书位置直接出现；这里记录原书最大相对 RE 度所需的 Turing 完备性，未把未核对的单射归约强化当作原书陈述。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-turing-equivalence","status":"resolved","id":"b2e9363a9f103e32","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-turing-equivalence]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-turing-reducibility","status":"resolved","id":"7ed23faee951231d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-turing-reducibility]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-turing-jump","status":"resolved","id":"36459bc8c6a3f6a6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","hea