$\\equiv_T$ 见 [[68-df-turing-equivalence]]；跳跃见 [[68-df-turing-jump]]；$\\mathrm{RE}^A$ 见 [[68-df-oracle-recursively-enumerable-set]]；$K$ 见 [[68-df-halting-set]]。","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-halting-set","status":"resolved","id":"eab12566d8ac44ad","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N$。$\\le_T,<_T$ 见 [[68-df-turing-reducibility]]，$\\equiv_T$ 见 [[68-df-turing-equivalence]]；跳跃见 [[68-df-turing-jump]]；$\\mathrm{RE}^A$ 见 [[68-df-oracle-recursively-enumerable-set]]；$K$ 见 [[68-df-halting-set]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\le_T,<_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\equiv_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RE}^A","display":false},{"tex":"K","display":false},{"tex":"A<_T A'.","display":true},{"tex":"A\\le_T B\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ A'\\le_T B'.","display":true},{"tex":"A'\\in\\mathrm{RE}^A\\ \\land\\ \\forall W\\in\\mathrm{RE}^A\\;(W\\le_T A').","display":true},{"tex":"\\varnothing'\\equiv_T K.","display":true}],"bytes":1628,"backlinks":[{"id":"43fcc2f44ce938e0","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"把原先只在 Remark 给出的度集合和零度常元移入 Assertion。原书将全函数的等价类称为度，并在 p.54 说明每个度都有集合代表，所以此集合表示与原书度结构相应。零跳与 K 的度相同，见 [[68-thm-jump-theorem]]；不要求 ∅′=K。"},{"id":"e86854d09364356c","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N$，$\\equiv_T$ 见 [[68-df-turing-equivalence]]，跳跃单调性见 [[68-thm-jump-theorem]]。"},{"id":"1391f74d0e8dd998","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal D,\\mathbf0$ 见 [[68-df-turing-degree]]，度序见 [[68-df-partial-order-on-degrees]]，度 join 见 [[68-df-degree-join]]，度跳跃见 [[68-df-degree-jump]]。跳跃性质见 [[68-thm-jump-theorem]]。"},{"id":"d10c661122833e3a","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"72b4a1b9eac21c78","anchor":"ref-16","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PostProblem}$ 见 [[68-df-post-problem]]，$\\mathrm{Int}$ 见 [[68-df-intermediate-degree]]；$\\mathrm{RE},\\mathrm{Recursive},K,\\le_T$ 分别见 [[68-df-recursively-enumerable-set]]、[[68-df-recursive-set]]、[[68-df-halting-set]]、[[68-df-turing-reducibility]]。使用 [[68-thm-friedberg-muchnik-theorem]] 与 [[68-thm-jump-theorem]]。"},{"id":"be41c4d7dd143cb1","anchor":"ref-127","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-thm-jump-theorem]] — theorem"},{"id":"3cb8c24064050ea6","anchor":"ref-174","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-thm-jump-theorem|thm-jump-theorem — Jump Theorem]]"}],"outgoing":["b2e9363a9f103e32","7ed23faee951231d","36459bc8c6a3f6a6","a48deec92f1ddb01","eab12566d8ac44ad"]}